## 4. The Honest Content Policy (per references/tone-of-voice.md)

- **Reviews:** {{review_source}} — {{review_count}} reviews, {{review_score}} average.
- **Hours:** Sourced from {{hours_source}} verbatim. No "Open 24/7" or "Mon-Sat" generalizations.
- **Prices:** {{pricing_source}}. Where not public, the site says "Confirm by WhatsApp". Never invented.
- **Photos:** Self-hosted from {{photo_source}}. Each `<img>` has `onerror` swap to a branded monogram.
- **CTA labels:** Concrete and per-intent. No "Learn more", "Get in touch", "Reach out".

